{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"You stand on the right.|The whole line stops."},{"id":"s2","text":"Everyone waits.|Wrong side."},{"id":"s3","text":"Escalator rules."},{"id":"s4","text":"Step left.|Let them pass."},{"id":"s5","text":"She taps your shoulder."},{"id":"s6","text":"Left—"},{"id":"s7","text":"You ride up.|They stream past."},{"id":"s8","text":"Top of the stairs.|Smooth exit."},{"id":"s9","text":"One side walks.|The other side waits."},{"id":"n1","text":"Stand on the left.|In Tokyo."},{"id":"n2","text":"Right side stays open.|For walkers."},{"id":"n3","text":"Osaka flips it.|Stand on the right."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}